    "detailed_description": "<strong>Keep the Balance! is a fast-paced puzzle game requiring basic math skills. </strong><br><br>An evil joker has invaded our world and tries to disturb The Magic Scales that balance our world, in order to unleash the forces of Chaos. Each level has a monkey standing on top of the scales. You have to keep the equilibrium by launching objects, passing below on a conveyor, onto the scales. All locations have unique sets of objects to which weight, shown as a number, has been assigned. As the objects appear from both sides of the screen at the same time, you move the cursor below an object and press a key to launch it. At the top of each scale, the current weight is shown. If there is a big gap in weight, the monkey will slowly slide to the heaviest side. <br><br>When it falls down, the game is over...",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Keep the Balance! is a fast-paced puzzle game requiring basic math skills. </strong><br><br>An evil joker has invaded our world and tries to disturb The Magic Scales that balance our world, in order to unleash the forces of Chaos. Each level has a monkey standing on top of the scales. You have to keep the equilibrium by launching objects, passing below on a conveyor, onto the scales. All locations have unique sets of objects to which weight, shown as a number, has been assigned. As the objects appear from both sides of the screen at the same time, you move the cursor below an object and press a key to launch it. At the top of each scale, the current weight is shown. If there is a big gap in weight, the monkey will slowly slide to the heaviest side. <br><br>When it falls down, the game is over...",
    "short_description": "Ever throw an elephant on a scale? Or chased an elephant away with a hair dryer? It's very easy. But always: KEEP THE BALANCE!",
